graph TB
    Internet((Internet))
    Internet --> Ingress[ingress-nginx<br/>general node pool]

    subgraph EKS["EKS Cluster: logging-eks (eu-west-2)"]
        subgraph appsns["namespace: applications"]
            OrderAPI["Order API x3<br/>Flask + gunicorn<br/>JSON logs to stdout"]
        end

        subgraph loggingns["namespace: logging"]
            Filebeat["Filebeat DaemonSet<br/>runs on general pool nodes"]
        end

        subgraph esns["namespace: elastic-system"]
            Kibana["Kibana x2"]

            subgraph esmaster["es-master node pool (3x m6i.large)"]
                M1[master-0]
                M2[master-1]
                M3[master-2]
            end

            subgraph esdata["es-data node pool (3x r6i.xlarge)"]
                D1[data-0]
                D2[data-1]
                D3[data-2]
            end
        end

        Vault["Vault Agent Injector<br/>(sidecar)"]
    end

    S3[("S3 Snapshot Bucket<br/>Glacier @ 30d, expire @ 365d")]

    Ingress -->|TLS via cert-manager<br/>+ Route53 DNS-01| Kibana
    Ingress -->|TLS| OrderAPI

    OrderAPI -.->|"container log file<br/>/var/log/containers/*.log"| Filebeat
    Filebeat -->|"HTTPS, bulk index<br/>app-logs-* alias"| D1
    Filebeat --> D2
    Filebeat --> D3

    Kibana -->|HTTPS 9200| D1

    M1 <-->|transport 9300, quorum| M2
    M2 <-->|transport 9300| M3
    M1 <--> D1
    M2 <--> D2
    M3 <--> D3

    D1 -->|SLM nightly snapshot<br/>IRSA, no static keys| S3
    D2 --> S3
    D3 --> S3

    Vault -.->|injects DB_PASSWORD,<br/>EXTERNAL_API_KEY| OrderAPI
    Vault -.->|injects ES credentials| Filebeat

    style esmaster fill:#eef,stroke:#446
    style esdata fill:#efe,stroke:#464
    style S3 fill:#fef,stroke:#646
